<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB Q2 NET PROFIT FALLS 1.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>ABB Q2 NET PROFIT FALLS 1.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>April 1 to June 30, 1997:</p>
<p>				    (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     331		 vs 337</p>
<p> Group operating earnings</p>
<p> after depreciation	   614		 vs 830</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 552		 vs 570</p>
<p> Group revenue		  8,180	     vs 8,557</p>
<p> Operating margin, percent  7.5		 vs 9.7</p>
<p> New orders		     9,973	     vs 9,102</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG. Figures for the second quarter are calculated by subtracting first quarter results from six month results.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
